        "enemy_name": "The Casual Court Crier",
        "enemy_type": "Palace Courtier",
        "pre_narrative": "The Casual Court Crier has been tasked with drafting the King's official proclamation regarding the upcoming census. He has delivered a document that opens: \"Hey everyone, so basically the King wants to count how many of you there are.\" The palace speechwriter hands you the draft with a look of despair.",
        "passage": "The royal census of the Keep shall commence on the first day of the harvest month. [1] All households are required to register their members with the district recorder. Failure to comply will result in the appropriate legal consequences. [2] It's super important that you fill this out right away so we don't have any issues.",
