        "enemy_name": "The Slangy Scrivener",
        "enemy_type": "Palace Courtier",
        "pre_narrative": "The Slangy Scrivener has been assigned to write the Keep's official annual report on agricultural production. His draft is factually accurate but tonally catastrophic. The opening paragraph reads like a harvest festival announcement at a tavern rather than a policy document.",
        "passage": "Agricultural output in the Keep has increased markedly over the past decade, owing primarily to advances in irrigation technology and crop rotation practices. The northern territories, in particular, have demonstrated exceptional yields. [1] Honestly, the farmers up there are totally crushing it — like, their numbers are way better than everyone expected.",
