        "pre_narrative": "The Inspector General's evaluation reports always conclude that the subject was \"okay.\" The palace armory was \"okay.\" The new aqueduct was \"okay.\" The treasury was \"okay.\" After eighteen months, the King can no longer tell which systems are functioning well and which are quietly failing. You must train the Inspector in precise evaluation language.",
        "passage": "After reviewing the palace guard's training program over the past quarter, the Inspector General concluded that the new combat drills were particularly okay in preparing soldiers for nighttime patrol scenarios.",
