        "passage": null,
        "question_stem": "Which version of the following sentence uses the colon correctly?\n\nThe Redundancy King's palace contains three distinct wings: the Hall of Repetition, the Gallery of Redundant Portraits, and the Archive of Duplicate Decrees.",
