        "pre_narrative": "\"Agreement,\" the King announces. \"Everything in my palace agrees — agrees, agrees, agrees.\" He hands you a sentence with the subject buried so deeply that finding it requires concentration. You focus.",
        "passage": null,
        "question_stem": "Which version of the following sentence is grammatically correct?\n\nBeyond the outermost walls of the Keep's harbor district stand ______ the old lighthouse and the watchtower that has monitored the bay for six centuries.",
