        "enemy_type": "Final Boss",
        "pre_narrative": "The King places a long, elaborate sentence before you. \"Find the verb,\" he says. \"If you can.\" Between the subject and the verb, he has inserted an obstacle course of prepositional phrases and relative clauses, each one designed to pull your attention away from the true subject.",
