        "pre_narrative": "The King is composing the Keep's new oath of office. It lists three duties. Two of the items are parallel. One is not — and the King likes the broken one best. \"It has personality,\" he says. You disagree.",
        "passage": null,
        "question_stem": "Which version of the following sentence uses parallel structure correctly throughout?\n",
